<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31929" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδπομ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>running out, sally, charge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.2.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.2.5
			</span></i>, al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐτησίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					36(48).8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abstr. for
			concrete, <i>party of skirmishers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.127
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>shooting, sprouting,</i> of trees, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>issue,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					4.57
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
			</span></i>
			
				Med.
			in<i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>digression in speaking,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				1.92J.
			</span></i> (pl.) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡἐ. τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agath.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				4.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>lapse</i> of time, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτῶν τετρακοσίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tz.
					<u>H.</u>
					8.56
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
